    "The control identity covers one_sweep_control_intervals and complete numeric checkpoint datasets. Longer candidate runs replay the first endpoint map bitwise in every interval; they are not a separate longer zero-versus-one-sweep trajectory comparison.",
    "Trajectory statistics are equally weighted over recorded coupling endpoints, excluding the shared initial state. Final forces and velocity metrics are independently recomputed from fields; earlier endpoints use the trial observer's records.",
